{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01QLeVUDBdkN5Y4Us48yzC5U","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PNTk6865s1e7EHkWC4eXea","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nMove stacked reduction Round 0 polynomial reconstruction to GPU\n\nReplace per-bucket D2H + CPU NTT pipeline in reconstruct_s0_from_g with a\nGPU-based pipeline using batch_ntt_small and AoS/SoA conversion primitives.\n\nThe GPU pipeline pre-computes all E evaluations on CPU, uploads them once,\nthen runs a 10-step kernel pipeline per bucket: AoS→SoA → iDFT → zero-pad →\nDFT → SoA→AoS → pointwise multiply → AoS→SoA → iDFT → SoA→AoS → accumulate.\nA single D2H copy retrieves the final accumulated result.\n\nAdds two new CUDA kernels (ef_pointwise_mul3_sum, ef_accumulate) and includes\na CPU fallback guard for l_skip > MAX_NTT_LEVEL - 1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\"","description":"Commit implementation"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":151,"cache_read_input_tokens":159451,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":151},"output_tokens":53,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a7dc5947-1fd2-4f8b-9741-c3b82c298994","uuid":"f3941b97-56c7-4dcc-8f3b-1828d1d1cf62"}
